1662:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h **** /**
1663:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @param channel Pointer to USIC channel handler of type @ref XMC_USIC_CH_t \n
1664:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 				   \b Range: @ref XMC_USIC0_CH0, @ref XMC_USIC0_CH1 to @ref XMC_USIC2_CH1 based on device su
1665:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @param event Events to be enabled. Multiple events can be bitwise OR combined. @ref XMC_USIC_CH_
1666:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @return None
1667:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
1668:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \par<b>Description</b><br>
1669:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Enables the interrupt events related to transmit FIFO. \n\n
1670:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Event bitmasks can be constructed using the enumeration @ref XMC_USIC_CH_TXFIFO_EVENT_CONF_t.
1671:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Multiple events can be enabled by providing multiple events in a single call. For providing
1672:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * multiple events, combine the events using bitwise OR operation. Events are configured in the TBC
1673:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
1674:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Note: API only enables the events. For interrupt generation, interrupt node must be configured a
1675:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * must be enabled.
1676:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
1677:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \par<b>Related APIs:</b><BR>
