1740:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @return None
1741:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
1742:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \par<b>Description</b><br>
1743:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Writes data into the transmit FIFO. \n\n
1744:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * The data provided is placed in the transmit FIFO.
1745:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * The transmit FIFO should be configured before calling this API.
1746:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
