1963:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Configures the receive FIFO. \n\n
1964:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Receive FIFO is the subset of a common FIFO sized 64 words. This FIFO is shared between 2 channe
1965:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Each channel can share the FIFO for transmission and reception. \a data_pointer represents the s
1966:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * from where received data can be put. \a size represents the size of receive FIFO as a multiple o
1967:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Since the FIFO is shared between 2 USIC channels, FIFO size should be carefully selected. A FIFO
1968:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * event or alternative receive buffer event is generated when the FIFO filling level exceeds the \
1969:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
1970:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \par<b>Related APIs:</b><BR>
