2023:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @param event Events to be enabled. Multiple events can be bitwise OR combined. @ref XMC_USIC_CH_
2024:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @return None
2025:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
2026:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \par<b>Description</b><br>
2027:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Enables the interrupt events related to transmit FIFO. \n\n
2028:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Event bitmasks can be constructed using the enumeration @ref XMC_USIC_CH_RXFIFO_EVENT_CONF_t.
2029:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Multiple events can be enabled by providing multiple events in a single call. For providing
2030:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * multiple events, combine the events using bitwise OR operation.<br>
2031:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
2032:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Note: API only enables the events. For interrupt generation, interrupt node must be configured a
2033:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * must be enabled.
2034:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
