 705:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  * @brief Registers a request for receiving data over I2C_MASTER channel using DMA.
 706:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  *
 707:D:/GITHUB/XMC14/TOF/Dave/Generated/I2C_MASTER\i2c_master.h ****  *
